      "description": "The meme implicitly references the broader social concept of racial hierarchy, where certain racial groups are positioned as superior or inferior to others. The text suggests that by using 'woman of color,' the speaker is implicitly placing white women outside of the 'inclusive' group, reinforcing a racial hierarchy.",
