      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The woman is mapped as 'woman of color' in the text",
      "description": "The text 'i say woman of color' explicitly labels the visual entity (the Black woman) as a 'woman of color'. This is an analogical mapping where the textual term 'woman of color' is applied to the visual entity, creating a direct semantic link between the text and the visual representation. The mapping is central to the meme's intent, as it uses the visual identity of the woman to instantiate the term 'woman of color' in a context that is then weaponized to exclude white women.",
